{"qid": "tt_t1_00006", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 15293.36, "n_tokens": 230, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.64, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 346, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "对方律师说得对，你的理解有误。理由如下：\n\n**一、《合同法》已失效**\n\n《中华人民共和国合同法》已于2021年1月1日《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起废止。因此，2026年起诉时，法院不会再适用《合同法》第一百九十六条。\n\n**二、应适用《民法典》第六百六十七条**\n\n《民法典》第六百六十七条规定：“借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同。”该条内容与《合同法》第一百九十六条实质相同，是现行有效的对应条文。2026年起诉，应依《民法典》第六百六十七条处理。\n\n**三、关于2016年发生的借款事实**\n\n需要区分“事实发生时间”与“起诉时间”：\n\n- 2016年发生的借款关系，其成立、效力等一般仍按当时有效的《合同法》等法律评价（《民法典》时间效力相关规定）；", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 15.287, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_196", "score": 0.8493, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 196, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_667", "score": 0.5626, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 667, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）沪01民再3021号_1", "score": 0.0674, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）沪01民再3021号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）京01民初2865号_1", "score": 0.0674, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）京01民初2865号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2023）渝01民初2624号_1", "score": 0.0674, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2023）渝01民初2624号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民初1653号_1", "score": 0.0637, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民初1653