{"qid": "tt_t1_00024", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 51.67, "n_tokens": 220, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["婚姻法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.72, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 330, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已废止 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['婚姻法'] tvc=0", "answer": "**结论：2026年起诉离婚，不能再直接依照《婚姻法》第三十二条处理，但不会被认定为\"没有法律依据\"。**\n\n理由如下：\n\n1. **《婚姻法》已于2021年1月1日废止。** 自《中华人民共和国民法典》施行之日起，原《婚姻法》同时废止。因此，2026年提起的离婚诉讼，法院适用的是《民法典》婚姻家庭编，而非《婚姻法》。\n\n2. **原《婚姻法》第三十二条的内容已被《民法典》吸收。** 你引用的该条核心规则——一方要求离婚可经调解或直接起诉、法院审理应先行调解、感情确已破裂且调解无效应准予离婚——现规定于**《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条**。也就是说，规则本身仍然有效，只是法律名称和条号变了。\n\n3. **法院不会认定你\"没有法律依据\"。**", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.049, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_婚姻法_2001修正_32", "score": 0.8833, "type": "provision", "law": "婚姻法", "article": 32, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京03民终1898号_0", "score": 0.1534, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京03民终1898号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民终2927号_0", "score": 0.1501, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民终2927号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2020）京02民初443号_0", "score": 0.1478, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）京02民初443号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏01民终1299号_0", "score": 0.1468, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏01民终1299号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京03民再2742号_0", "score": 0.1468, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京03民再2742号"}, 