{"qid": "tt_t2_00030", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 46.18, "n_tokens": 234, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 0, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": true, "invalid_laws": ["合同法"], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 351, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=已修订 as_of=2026-11-01 invalid_cited=['合同法'] tvc=0", "answer": "结论：你查到的《合同法》第五十二条确实已经不再作为现行有效法律适用了。《合同法》已于2021年1月1日随《民法典》施行而废止，相关内容已被《民法典》吸收、调整。\n\n就你引用的这一项而言，现行法下需要注意两点变化：\n\n1. **欺诈、胁迫不再以“损害国家利益”为无效要件**\n   - 依《民法典》第一百四十八条、第一百五十条，一方以欺诈手段使对方在违背真实意思的情况下实施的民事法律行为，受欺诈方有权请求撤销；一方以胁迫手段使对方在违背真实意思的情况下实施的民事法律行为，受胁迫方有权请求撤销。\n   - 也就是说，通常属于**可撤销**，而不是一律无效。\n\n2. **损害国家利益导致无效的情形**\n   - 依《民法典》第一百五十三条，违反法律、行政法规的强制性规定的民事法律行为无效，但是该强制性", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.044, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_合同法_1999_52", "score": 0.8803, "type": "provision", "law": "合同法", "article": 52, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_563", "score": 0.3327, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 563, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.267, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_497", "score": 0.2625, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 497, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再395号_0", "score": 0.2619, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再395号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再414号_0", "score": 0.2619, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再414号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_496