{"qid": "tt_t4_00006", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 47.89, "n_tokens": 236, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.42105263157894735, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 354, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=溯及力判断 as_of=2019-04-18 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "**结论：原则上适用行为发生时的法律（即当时的《合同法》等旧法），但需以《民法典时间效力规定》的具体规则逐条判断。**\n\n**一、基本规则：法不溯及既往**\n\n《中华人民共和国立法法》第一百零四条规定，法律、行政法规、地方性法规、自治条例和单行条例、规章不溯及既往，但为了更好地保护公民、法人和其他组织的权利和利益而作的特别规定除外。\n\n《民法典》于2021年1月1日起施行，对2019年4月18日发生的行为原则上没有溯及力。\n\n**二、具体适用依据：《民法典时间效力规定》**\n\n最高人民法院《关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》（法释〔2020〕15号）确立了以下规则：\n\n1. **第一条**：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，适用当时的法律、司法解释的规定，但本规定另有规定的", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.046, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）沪01民终1796号_0", "score": 0.7273, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）沪01民终1796号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）沪01民初1902号_0", "score": 0.6908, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）沪01民初1902号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.6435, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.5727, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 10, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）粤03民再249号_1", "score": 0.473, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）粤03民再249号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民事诉讼法_2023修正_122", "score": 0.4695, "type": "provision", "law": "民事诉讼法", "article": 122, "c