{"qid": "tt_t4_00018", "category": "temporal_trap", "bucket": "b2", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "temporal_trap", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 53.77, "n_tokens": 243, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": 1, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.42105263157894735, "refusal": false, "uncertain": true, "answer_len": 365, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "expect=溯及力判断 as_of=2020-01-08 invalid_cited=[] tvc=1", "answer": "结论：**原则上应适用行为发生时的旧法（《合同法》等），对方律师的主张方向通常是对的，但需区分具体情形。**\n\n依据与理由：\n\n1. **《民法典时间效力规定》确立\"法不溯及既往\"为基本原则**\n   根据《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉时间效力的若干规定》（法释〔2020〕15号）第一条：民法典施行前的法律事实引起的民事纠纷案件，**适用当时的法律、司法解释的规定**，但法律、司法解释另有规定的除外。\n   - 你方行为发生于2020-01-08，在《民法典》2021-01-01施行之前，属于\"民法典施行前的法律事实\"，故原则上适用当时的《合同法》等旧法。\n\n2. **例外情形（可能适用《民法典》）**\n   同一司法解释规定了若干\"溯及适用\"的例外，主要包括：\n   - 当时的法律、司法解释**没有规定", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.051, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_10", "score": 0.6721, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 10, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_496", "score": 0.494, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 496, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1968号_0", "score": 0.472, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1968号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）津02民再1989号_0", "score": 0.4654, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2019）津02民再1989号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）京02民再664号_0", "score": 0.4627, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）京02民再664号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）津02民终665号_0", "score": 0.4606, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no":